 hermes_cli/AGENTS.md                              | 5 +++--
 website/docs/getting-started/updating.md          | 4 ++--
 website/docs/user-guide/multi-profile-gateways.md | 2 +-
 3 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

